193
00:10:28,230 --> 00:10:29,690
"I already have a spouse,

194
00:10:31,610 --> 00:10:33,490
and he is scary.

195
00:10:36,250 --> 00:10:39,210
He can kick a can from here
and send it flying to Khon Kaen.

196
00:10:40,090 --> 00:10:42,850
He can even knock down
a banana tree in one kick."

197
00:10:43,770 --> 00:10:44,850
Knock down a banana tree?

198
00:10:44,870 --> 00:10:46,470
It was you who got knocked down by me.

199
00:10:46,490 --> 00:10:47,810
Aww...that hurt.

200
00:10:51,210 --> 00:10:52,290
I changed my mind for today, then.

201
00:10:54,690 --> 00:10:55,490
Tonight,

202
00:10:55,970 --> 00:10:57,290
