209
00:11:13,530 --> 00:11:14,170
Please?

210
00:11:16,770 --> 00:11:17,850
Yes, Chubby!

211
00:11:24,650 --> 00:11:27,050
Hug. Give me a hug, Chubby.
- Whoa, you're strong.

212
00:11:27,130 --> 00:11:28,010
Hugging Chubby.

213
00:11:55,370 --> 00:11:55,970
Whoa!

214
00:11:59,010 --> 00:11:59,610
Hey.

215
00:12:00,170 --> 00:12:01,650
No matter what festival it is,

216
00:12:01,810 --> 00:12:02,610
whether it's New Year,

217
00:12:02,630 --> 00:12:03,570
Lunar New Year,

218
00:12:03,590 --> 00:12:04,570
Buddhist Lent Day,

219
00:12:04,810 --> 00:12:06,030
Songkran Day,

220
00:12:06,050 --> 00:12:07,010
or Loy Krathong,

221
