222
00:12:10,060 --> 00:12:11,300
Who came up with it?

223
00:12:12,050 --> 00:12:14,210
I came up with it.

224
00:12:15,930 --> 00:12:17,170
Oh.

225
00:12:17,230 --> 00:12:18,410
It's such a brilliant idea,
I was gonna say.

226
00:12:18,470 --> 00:12:20,750
There are over a thousand kinds of ghosts, right?

227
00:12:20,770 --> 00:12:22,410
That's why it's such a flexible theme.

228
00:12:22,930 --> 00:12:23,810
Amazing job.

229
00:12:24,010 --> 00:12:25,330
